id: DRAFT-tiny-aes-c-0.4.2-source-only-static-and-wrapper-flags
title: Source-only C++ archives on HarmonyOS need profile tools and wrapper-warning isolation
path: B
category: conan, clang, ohos, static-library, testing
trigger_tool: conan|clang|llvm-ar
error_signature: -Wl,--code-sign.*unused|no test source|copy_n is not a member of std
root_cause: source-only upstream archive and OHOS clang wrapper linker flags appearing in compile commands
rec_approach: profile compiler/ar lookup, focused warning demotion, installed consumer vectors
verification_cmd: conan create clean -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing -tf=test_package
evidence: HarmonyOS HongMeng Kernel 1.12.0 aarch64; upstream 0 tests; consumer 12/12 passed
forbid_1: use host g++ or ar names when the Conan profile supplies the target tools
forbid_2: disable all warnings as errors to hide wrapper-injected linker arguments
similar_to: []
draft: true
